        "793. 比较下列各分数的大小：",
        "1) $\\frac{5}{7}$和$\\frac{7}{10}$；　　　　3) $\\frac{4}{7}$和$\\frac{7}{10}$；",
        "2) $\\frac{11}{8}$和$\\frac{13}{11}$；　　　4) $\\frac{12}{11}$和$\\frac{11}{10}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "794",
